IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `crm-provisions`
IMPORT `crm-xrefs`

-- Tests for crm-provisions.l4 and crm-xrefs.l4. Generated by work/gen_index.py
-- from the text file. For every row of the cross-reference file: the section
-- cited is in the index, the subsection cited is one the section prints, and the
-- row's heading is the index's heading. A row for another instrument is not
-- resolved: its kind and its instrument are as quoted.

§ `Tests of the provision index and the cross-reference rows`

§§ `The provision index`

#ASSERT `the provision with the identifier` "4Z" EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `the heading as printed of the provision with the identifier` "4Z" EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `the provision prints the subsection` "4Z" "(1)" EQUALS FALSE
#ASSERT `the provision prints the subsection` "4J" "(9)" EQUALS FALSE
#ASSERT `the provision prints the subsection` "4J" "(7)" EQUALS TRUE
#ASSERT `the provision prints the subsection` "4JA" "(4)" EQUALS TRUE
#ASSERT `the provision prints the subsection` "4E" "(1)" EQUALS FALSE
#ASSERT `the heading as printed of the provision with the identifier` "3" EQUALS JUST "Interpretation"
#ASSERT `the heading as printed of the provision with the identifier` "4A" EQUALS JUST "Meaning of certain words"
#ASSERT `the heading as printed of the provision with the identifier` "4AA" EQUALS JUST "Penalty units"
#ASSERT `the heading as printed of the provision with the identifier` "4AB" EQUALS JUST "Conversion of pecuniary penalties expressed in dollar amounts to penalty units"
#ASSERT `the heading as printed of the provision with the identifier` "4B" EQUALS JUST "Pecuniary penalties—natural persons and bodies corporate"
#ASSERT `the heading as printed of the provision with the identifier` "4C" EQUALS JUST "Offences under 2 or more laws"
#ASSERT `the heading as printed of the provision with the identifier` "4D" EQUALS JUST "Penalties"
#ASSERT `the heading as printed of the provision with the identifier` "4E" EQUALS JUST "Pecuniary penalties"
#ASSERT `the heading as printed of the provision with the identifier` "4F" EQUALS JUST "Effect of alterations in penalties"
#ASSERT `the heading as printed of the provision with the identifier` "4G" EQUALS JUST "Indictable offences"
#ASSERT `the heading as printed of the provision with the identifier` "4H" EQUALS JUST "Summary offences"
#ASSERT `the heading as printed of the provision with the identifier` "4J" EQUALS JUST "Certain indictable offences may be dealt with summarily"
#ASSERT `the heading as printed of the provision with the identifier` "4JA" EQUALS JUST "Some indictable offences punishable by fine only may be dealt with summarily"
#ASSERT `the heading as printed of the provision with the identifier` "4K" EQUALS JUST "Continuing and multiple offences"
#ASSERT `the heading as printed of the provision with the identifier` "4L" EQUALS JUST "Specified defences not to preclude other defences"
#ASSERT `the heading as printed of the provision with the identifier` "4M" EQUALS JUST "Children under 10"
#ASSERT `the heading as printed of the provision with the identifier` "4N" EQUALS JUST "Children over 10 but under 14"
#ASSERT `the heading as printed of the provision with the identifier` "Part I" EQUALS JUST "Preliminary"
#ASSERT `the heading as printed of the provision with the identifier` "Part IA" EQUALS JUST "General"

